    "de": [
      "In diesem Dorfrestaurant entdecken Sie am Holzfeuer gegrilltes Fleisch mit hausgemachten Pommes frites. Mit einem Wort: Authentizität!"
    ],
    "en": [
      "In this village restaurant, come and discover meat grilled over a wood fire accompanied by homemade fries. In a word, authenticity!"
    ],
    "it": [
      "In questo ristorante di paese, venite a scoprire le carni grigliate a legna accompagnate da patatine fritte fatte in casa. In una parola: autenticità!"
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Dans ce restaurant de village, venez découvrir des viandes grillées au feu de bois accompagnés de frites maison. En un mot, authenticité !"
    ],
    "nl": [
